Player boot stays anonymous Supabase Auth. When an account is bound to a person, **email OTP / magic link through existing Supabase Auth** is the required possession factor. Do not add Auth0/Clerk/Firebase Auth. Do not invent OTPs, JWTs, or a password-only login.

After auth, RLS, secrets, CI, or `innerHTML` changes: run `python .cursor/skills/cyber-watch/scripts/scan.py --diff --gate` or `/cyber-watch`. Treat CYBER ALARM ship-stopper / high as blockers. Do not `--no-verify`.
